{"municipality_code":"12230","pref":"千葉県","city":"八街市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"八街市には、文違村、雁丸新田村、榎戸新田村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「根古谷城跡」、「法宣寺」、「永福寺」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では文違村、雁丸新田村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 田・新田・用水にちなむ地名が多い場所では、土地改良碑や用水記念碑も注目したい探索対象です。 「八街神社」や「寝釈迦」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":191,"rank":416,"percentile":78.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":13,"rank":827,"percentile":55.0,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":9,"rank":1681,"percentile":9.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":13,"rank":601,"percentile":64.6,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":2,"rank":1181,"percentile":27.7,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":1,"rank":1445,"percentile":12.5,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":15,"rank":946,"percentile":48.0,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["八街神社","寝釈迦"],"food_cult